---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config.mjs';
const parentUrl = (SITE.parentCompanyUrl || '').trim();
---
<PageLayout title="About" eyebrow={`About ${SITE.name}`} description={`Who runs ${SITE.name}, why we focus on side sleepers, and how our research-based product recommendations are made.`}>
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    {SITE.name} is an independent guide for side sleepers who want a more comfortable sleep setup. The site is run by
    the {SITE.author} and is a property of{' '}
    {parentUrl ? <a href={parentUrl}>{SITE.parentCompany}</a> : <strong>{SITE.parentCompany}</strong>}, a small
    company that publishes focused, helpful websites on everyday topics.
  </p>

  <h2>Who this site helps</h2>
  <p>
    If you spend most of the night on your side and wake up wishing your pillow, mattress or bedroom felt a little
    better, this site is for you. We explain the "why" behind comfort — loft, firmness, materials and sleep
    environment — so you can make your own informed choices.
  </p>

  <h2>How we research recommendations</h2>
  <p>We want to be completely transparent: <strong>our guides are research-based, not hands-on product tests.</strong> We do not currently run a testing lab, and we will never claim to have personally tested a product unless we actually have. To build our guides we:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Study how different materials and designs (memory foam, latex, shredded foam, down and fiber fills, contoured shapes) generally behave.</li>
    <li>Review manufacturer specifications, care instructions, trial periods and warranty terms.</li>
    <li>Read widely available buyer feedback to spot recurring themes — both positive and negative.</li>
    <li>Refer to reputable, general sleep-hygiene guidance from established health organizations, without making medical claims.</li>
    <li>Update guides when products, materials or information change.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Product recommendations focus on <em>who a type of product may suit</em> and its potential drawbacks. Comfort is
    personal, so we always encourage checking return policies and sleep trials before you buy.
  </p>

  <h2>How we make money</h2>
  <p>
    Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you buy through them, we may earn a commission at no extra cost to
    you. This helps keep the site free. Commissions never change what we write or which product types we discuss.
    Read our full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <p>
    We are not doctors, physical therapists or sleep specialists, and we don't give medical advice. Nothing on this
    site is intended to diagnose, treat or cure any condition. If you have ongoing pain or sleep problems, please talk
    with a healthcare professional. See our <a href="/medical-disclaimer/">Medical Disclaimer</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Get in touch</h2>
  <p>Questions, corrections or suggestions? We'd love to hear from you — visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a>.</p>
</PageLayout>
